# Ad Harness credentials template. Never commit .env (it holds real secrets).
#
# All credentials are per-workspace. A workspace = a folder under workspaces/; every key is
# prefixed with that folder's name UPPERCASED (workspaces/Acme → ACME_*). Tools pick the
# prefix from the path being worked on. There is NO shared fallback: each workspace uses only
# its own keys. A workspace's capabilities are whatever keys it declares — generation, R2,
# Drive, Notion, any subset.
#
# This file holds no real workspace names on purpose — the harness carries zero client context.
# Real, filled-in blocks live in the team vault (one item per workspace). Setup = create .env
# and paste the block(s) for the workspaces you work on.
#
# Copy the block below once per workspace, replacing <WORKSPACE>:

# ── <WORKSPACE> ─────────────────────────────────────────

# Generation + media library. Images, video and voiceovers (generate-image/video/voice) try
# SEGMIND, then KIE (https://kie.ai/api-key), then AI_GATEWAY (Vercel → AI Gateway → API keys),
# skipping any key that's missing; --provider segmind|kie|gateway forces one, and
# <WORKSPACE>_PROVIDER_ORDER (e.g. kie,gateway) sets one workspace's exact list; providers left out are skipped.
# AI_GATEWAY also runs the media library's analysis and search (catalog-media / search-media). Music and SFX need
# SEGMIND (Seed Audio); KIE only for Suno music. Routing lives in tools/lib/providers.mjs.
<WORKSPACE>_AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
<WORKSPACE>_SEGMIND_API_KEY=
<WORKSPACE>_KIE_API_KEY=
# Optional: ElevenLabs, called directly by the agent (no tool reads it) to isolate a voice or swap
# one while keeping a take's delivery (make-ai-slides, make-ai-animation).
<WORKSPACE>_ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=

# Brand context store (sync-brand). R2 S3-API token with Object Read & Write on the
# workspace's bucket — personal per teammate, scoped to that bucket.
<WORKSPACE>_R2_ACCOUNT_ID=
<WORKSPACE>_R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
<WORKSPACE>_R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
<WORKSPACE>_R2_BUCKET=
# The shared library (workspaces/Shared/Library) is its own workspace, "SHARED": its own bucket
# (shared-library) and token in SHARED_R2_*, plus SHARED_AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY for cataloging/search.

# Google Drive (sync-to-drive, pull-media). One-time consent with YOUR OWN Google account:
#   node tools/connect-drive.mjs <oauth-client.json> <WORKSPACE>
# writes _DRIVE_CLIENT_ID / _DRIVE_CLIENT_SECRET / _DRIVE_REFRESH_TOKEN. Set _DRIVE_FOLDER
# (the workspace's Drive folder ID) by hand.
<WORKSPACE>_DRIVE_CLIENT_ID=
<WORKSPACE>_DRIVE_CLIENT_SECRET=
<WORKSPACE>_DRIVE_REFRESH_TOKEN=
<WORKSPACE>_DRIVE_FOLDER=

# Notion Ads Board (sync-to-notion). Optional — only workspaces that review on Notion.
<WORKSPACE>_NOTION_TOKEN=

